  "story": {
    "day": 59,
    "title": "A Fun Day After School",
    "sentences": [
      "Ken, a boy, and his classmate Kaya got on a big bus together.",
      "First, they got off at the station to get to a gym.",
      "In the gym, they played volleyball and table tennis.",
      "They sometimes practiced track and field because they liked sports.",
      "\"What does your father do?\" asked Kaya.",
      "\"He is an office worker, but he doesn't work today,\" Ken said.",
      "Then, they went to Ken's house to read a book.",
      "They sat on the floor of a room with a purple wall.",
      "The room has a telephone, so Ken could send a message.",
      "He often did this to talk with another friend.",
      "Next, they saw a beautiful bird fly outside the window.",
      "Finally, they ate delicious eggplant at a table."
    ]
  }
}